e his life as an entertainer on the road with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-tv-fathers-greatest-dads-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d204\"},\"ref\":\"d204\",\"snippet\":\" ... The data are based on linkages between the Utah Population Database and Medicare claims that hold medical diagnoses data. We show that offspring whose parents died when they were children, but especially when they were adolescents/young adults, have modest but significant mortality risks after age 65. What ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4087105/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d205\"},\"ref\":\"d205\",\"snippet\":\" ... She witnesses the Duchess's wedding and delivers her children. She dies tragically by strangling following the murder of the Duchess and the youngest children. Her name plays on the Italian carriolo, meaning \\\"trundle-bed\\\", where personal servants would have slept.\\n*Julia – Castruchio's wife and the Cardinal ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Duchess_of_Malfi\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d206\"},\"ref\":\"d206\",\"snippet\":\" ... Thomas also died at a young age.\\n\\nLincoln's father Thomas later remarried the widow Sarah Bush Johnston, who had three children of her own.\\n\\nChester Arthur was the oldest son in his family\\n\\nChester Arthur's birth was the cause for great celebration on the part of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/us-presidents-birth-order-2018-7\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\